<title>POLAND: Polish Unibud to start bourse trade May 27.</title>
<headline>Polish Unibud to start bourse trade May 27.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Unibud SA will start bourse trade on the main market on May 27, the bourse's president said on Friday.</p>
<p>January one-million-share initial public offering of the firm priced at 15 zlotys per share was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
